From adfe8b07b87848ef7f55991e55e80f4039b5c825 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pipodi <pipodi93@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 15:19:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] d2d1: Fix build and warnings in the Layers and
 DrawImage paths

The device.c halves of the upstream 'Fix build' and 'Fix warnings treated as
errors' patches that the earlier CachyOS series omitted along with Layers:
drops const from d2d_layer_stack_push's entry parameter and hoists declarations
so the Layers and DrawImage code compiles with
-Werror=declaration-after-statement.
---
 dlls/d2d1/device.c | 63 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------
 1 file changed, 33 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

